OL,3,ATate brothers blast US jail conditions
OL,4,Aas they seek bail in UK extradition
OL,5,Afight
OL,6,
OL,7,FGovernment lawyers argued that the two
OL,8,Fwere a flight risk and had bragged
OL,9,Fabout having multiple passports, while
OL,10,Fdefence attorneys said the two social
OL,11,Fmedia influencers' high profile would
OL,12,Fmake it almost impossible for them to
OL,13,Fflee.
OL,15,FUS Magistrate Judge Lauren Louis will
OL,16,Fissue a written ruling at a later date
OL,17,Fon whether to grant bail to the dual
OL,18,FBritish-US citizens. The two were
OL,19,Farrested in Miami on 19 July.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
